From 3328d119c2245920e98054464c329147e746067d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 11:54:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www/shared: delete AiCloud/WebDAV/CloudSync remnants (Phase
 1.3)

Pages: cloud_*.asp (6), aicloud_qis.asp, update_cloudstatus.asp,
getsharelink.asp, get_webdavInfo.asp, Advanced_AiDisk_webdav.asp +
images/cloudsync/ + aicloud_logo.png. The 3 webdav pages still STAGED on
this build (their stock www/Makefile rm sits in ifneq(RTCONFIG_USB,y))
now vanish by source deletion; cloud_* were already unstaged via the
!CLOUDSYNC rm block.
nvram: drop the always-compiled webdav (13) + cloudsync (5) defaults
blocks from shared/defaults.c - every remaining compiled-in reader is
write-side bookkeeping or renders an empty string; no kept GUI page
applies these vars. mastiff/aaews carry no webdav/aicloud strings.
Sources: delete CloudSync client trees (asuswebstorage, webdav_client,
smartsync_api, inotify, neon, google_client, dropbox_client,
APP-IPK/AiCloud-tmp) - referenced only via obj-$(RTCONFIG_CLOUDSYNC),
flag permanently unset; APP-IPK/MediaServer-ipk kept.
menuTree AiCloud block + state.js support flags + dict tokens left in
place per the standing GUI-cleanup caveat (menu auto-hides at runtime).
